# Most Important Patterns to Remember

## Pattern 1 — Range

```python
range(1, n + 1)
```

Means:

```text
1 through n
```

---

## Pattern 2 — Divisibility

```python
number % divisor == 0
```

Means:

```text
number is divisible by divisor
```

---

## Pattern 3 — Factor

```python
number % factor == 0
```

Means:

```text
factor is a factor of number
```

---

## Pattern 4 — Accumulator

```python
sum = 0

sum += value
```

Means:

```text
keep adding values to a running total
```

---

## Pattern 5 — Digit Extraction

```python
digit = value % 10
```

Gets the last digit.

```python
value //= 10
```

Removes the last digit.

---

## Pattern 6 — GCD

```python
remainder = first % second
first = second
second = remainder
```

Repeat until:

```python
second == 0
```

---

## Pattern 7 — LCM

```text
LCM = (first × second) / GCD
```

For integer output:

```python
lcm = abs(first * second) // abs(gcd)
```

---

## Pattern 8 — Strong Number

```text
GET DIGIT
↓
FACTORIAL
↓
ADD
↓
REMOVE DIGIT
↓
REPEAT
↓
COMPARE
```

---

## Pattern 9 — AP

```python
term += difference
```

Memory:

```text
AP → ADD
```

---

## Pattern 10 — GP

```python
term *= ratio
```

Memory:

```text
GP → MULTIPLY
```

