# Master Memory Pattern

Most of these questions follow one of these patterns:

```text
LOOP
↓
CHECK
↓
CALCULATE
↓
UPDATE
↓
REPEAT
```

or:

```text
EXTRACT
↓
TRANSFORM
↓
ACCUMULATE
↓
REPEAT
```

The goal is not just to memorize the code.

The goal is to understand:

```text
WHAT IS THE INPUT?
        ↓
WHAT DO I NEED TO CHECK?
        ↓
WHAT SHOULD I CALCULATE?
        ↓
WHAT SHOULD I UPDATE?
        ↓
WHEN SHOULD THE LOOP STOP?
        ↓
WHAT IS THE FINAL ANSWER?
```

That thinking pattern is the foundation for the DSA problems that come next.
